sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant CreateByTemplate
    participant DB as OutboxEvent (DB)
    participant Worker as ContainerCreateWorker
    participant Runtime as Docker/K8s

    Client->>CreateByTemplate: 请求创建容器
    CreateByTemplate->>DB: 创建 ContainerInstance (status=pending)
    CreateByTemplate->>DB: 写入 OutboxEvent (type=ContainerCreateRequest)
    CreateByTemplate-->>Client: 返回 inst (status=pending)

    loop 每 2s 轮询
        Worker->>DB: 查询 pending ContainerCreateRequest
        Worker->>Worker: 获取信号量 (限并发)
        Worker->>CreateByTemplate: executeCreate()
        Worker->>Runtime: rt.Create() + rt.Start()
        Worker->>DB: 标记 OutboxEvent 为 sent
        Worker->>Worker: 释放信号量
    end